# Edge configuration — read only by the `caddy` service in docker-compose.yml.
#
# Values here must never contain a `$`: Docker Compose interpolates env_file
# contents, so `$anything` is replaced with an environment lookup — silently,
# leaving a value that is merely wrong rather than an error. Nothing secret
# belongs in this file; the console password is hashed into `.env` instead.

# The single site address Caddy answers on and requests a certificate for. It
# must resolve to this VPS via an A record before the stack starts, or ACME
# validation fails.
#
# Keep this to one name. `evokz.in`, `www.evokz.in` and `app.brivokz.com` were
# all removed on 2026-08-06 — the apex and the brivokz.com subdomain are being
# held for unrelated sites, so this VPS must not claim, redirect, or hold
# certificates for them. Anything listed here is a name this server owns.
APP_DOMAIN="app.evokz.in"

# Let's Encrypt expiry notices go here.
ACME_EMAIL="you@example.com"
